    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market, this is a superb opportunity to acquire a spacious top floor studio apartment in this mature and highly sought after development. Apartment 45 Ashurst offers an excellent opportunity for purchasers to create a home to their own taste and specification as this property is presented as a blank canvas with enormous potential. Being on the top floor, the views across both Dublin City and Dublin Bay are spectacular. \n\nThe apartment further benefits from one designated car parking space together with a visitor parking. Ashurst is a well-established and well maintained development, renowned for its mature landscaped grounds and exceptional location, making it an ideal choice for both first time buyers, owner occupiers and investors seeking to add value in a prime residential setting, or someone looking for a property close to UCD/Dublin City.\n\n - Please email our office to receive information about the available viewings and to book your appointment. - \n\n\nAccommodation:\nWalking into the apartment via an entrance hallway, you enter into a large open plan living/dining/sleeping space, large enough to be partitioned with ease. There is a separate kitchen and a bathroom with w.c and bath."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "4th floor Studio apartment\nParking for one car, plus visitors parking\nService charges for 2026 are 3,035.18 Euro, inclusive of central heating\nClose to UCD\nTop floor apartment, with views across both Dublin City and Dublin Bay\nLift access to all floors\nMains - Electricity\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER E\nBER No. 119558922\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "The location of this property is second to none. Situated on Mount Merrion Avenue, it enjoys an enviable position with the vibrant villages of Blackrock and Stillorgan on the doorstep, offering an excellent selection of cafes, restaurants, boutiques, shopping centres, and a wide range of everyday amenities.\n\nLocated close to the coast, residents can enjoy sea swimming, sailing, scenic coastal walks, and the beautiful views across Dublin Bay. The nearby UCD Belfield campus is also within a short walk, making the property ideally suited to students, academics, and professionals alike. St Vincents Hosipital is also a short 7 minute drive away.\n\nThe property is exceptionally well connected, with the N11 Quality Bus Corridor on the Stillorgan Dual Carriageway providing frequent direct services to Dublin city centre and beyond. The DART station in Blackrock, located at the opposite end of Mount Merrion Avenue, offers a fast and convenient rail link, making this an ideal location for commuters."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Danielle Stephenson"
      }
    ],
